    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d444">

                <pb facs="1195" n="1189" xml:id="pg1189"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Gresham to Mr.
                            Blount.</hi></head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">No. 2.]</seg>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Department of State</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1893-05-22"><hi rendition="#italic">May 22,
                        1893</hi></date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir</hi>: I inclose herewith, the letter of the
                    President recalling Mr. John L. Stevens, your predecessor in the mission to the
                    Hawaiian Islands, with an office copy of the same.</p>
                <p>Mr. Stevens, having taken his departure from Honolulu, you will, at the same time
                    you ask an audience for the purpose of presenting your letters of credence,
                    request the privilege of delivering Mr. Steven’s letters of recall in view of
                    his departure before they could reach him.</p>
                <p>I am, etc.,</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">W. Q. Gresham.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
